<title>GERMANY: Schering says Q1 net profit up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Schering says Q1 net profit up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   152    vs 131</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     292    vs 234</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,465  vs 1,206</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    --domestic				   250    vs 191</p>
<p>    --foreign				    1,215  vs 1,015</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    21,084 vs 19,023</p>
<p>    Group staff costs			  471    vs 419</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals group is Schering AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
